 Source/Broiler.HTML.Image/BCanvas.cs          | 149 +++++++++++++++++-
 .../IR/PaintWalker.Stacking.cs                |  29 ++++
 .../IR/RGraphicsRasterBackend.cs              |  12 ++
 4 files changed, 209 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

